title: Two forks I made may not be worth keeping.
pid: 6ce04c7f-fc63-43a2-8ba6-5461c5e9ae1c
body: |2-
  My fork of "management team" exists only to test hiding a child; it hides Gen and now stands in for Jeff's note in all my views. My fork of "Need skg-diff mode from any view." holds my answer, and I mean it. Drop the first if you like.
